bottled-uptime-kuma
===================

This repository packages Uptime Kuma for Cloud in a Bottle / OpenHost.

Uptime Kuma
-----------
This image is built FROM the official Uptime Kuma container image and
distributes Uptime Kuma, a self-hosted uptime monitoring tool.

  Upstream:    https://github.com/louislam/uptime-kuma
  License:     MIT License, Copyright (c) 2021 Louis Lam
  Base image:  docker.io/louislam/uptime-kuma:2 (see the FROM line in the Dockerfile)

Uptime Kuma is distributed under the MIT License. Its copyright notice and the
MIT permission notice are reproduced in LICENSE, as MIT requires for
redistribution. Uptime Kuma's source is not modified by this package; the
container entrypoint only binds its data directory to persistent storage and,
on first boot, seeds the owner admin user and disables Uptime Kuma's own login
(Cloud in a Bottle's owner gate is the authentication).

